IMPORTANT NOTE ON LICENSING:
Because this project statically links and integrates with the proprietary fMSX core, the entire combined software distribution inherits the non-commercial restriction. This creates a technical licensing conflict with the GPL-3.0 retro-go framework. This repository is published as a "Source Available" hobby project for educational purposes and preservation of computing history. YOU MAY NOT SELL, MONETIZE, OR COMMERCIALLY DISTRIBUTE THIS WORK.
